<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Altera Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Altera Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- SoundView Financial Group said it raised its rating on Altera Corp to short-term buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- It said it kept its long-term buy rating.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 5-5/8 at 59-1/2.</p>
</text>
